# NOTE: /vendor/*.tgz (packed @ums/shared and @ums/design-system tarballs) is intentionally
# NOT ignored here -- package.json pins them as file: deps (see README "Local package
# consumption"), so they must be committed for `npm ci` to succeed until the platform's
# private npm registry exists.
